[LINK: (^) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manhattan#cite_ref-42]  History,  [LINK: (Governor's Island) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor%27s_Island] . Accessed December 24, 2023. "The Dutch West India Company first arrived to New Amsterdam and opted to set up camp on the small, 70-acre Island rather than brave the wilderness that lay across the water on the island that would later be known as Manhattan."

